1
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:03,780
Previously on Friends:

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:06,610
Erica, are you okay?

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:06,610
Yeah, you know, maybe I ate too much.

4
