I keep getting these stomachaches. They come and go, like, every few minutes.

5
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:17,540
Oh, my God.

6
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:17,540
Relax, we'll just get her some antacids.

7
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:20,670
She doesn't have a stomachache! She's in labor!

8
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:21,880
Qh, my God!

9
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:24,010
If you think that I didn't say goodbye...

10
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,590
...because you don't mean as much to me as everybody else, you're wrong.

11
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,550
It's because you mean more to me.

12
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:31,640
Rash!

13
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:31,640
What?

14
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:57,250
Hey.

15
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:57,250
Ha, ha.

16
00:00:57,420 --> 00:01:00,670
Shh. Go back to sleep. I have to go home.

17
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:04,460
Oh, God. This was amazing.

18
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:07,430
It really was.

19
00:01:08,050 --> 00:01:10,510
You've learned some new moves.

20
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:15,890
Yeah, well, uh, this guy at work gave me Sex for Dummies as a joke.

21
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,560
Ah.

22
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,560
Who's laughing now?

23
00:01:17,730 --> 00:01:19,060
I am.

24
00:02:09,450 --> 00:02:13,280
Breathe. Breathe. Breathe.

25
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:16,660
Okay. Good.

26
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:18,370
Next time, can I say "breathe"?

27
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:21,580
No. Last time, you said it like Dracula, and it scared her.

28
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:25,340
Can I get you anything? Want more ice chips?

29
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:28,510
No, I'm okay.

30
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:28,510
All right. I'll be right back.

31
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:33,180
Where you going?

32
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:33,180
To use the bathroom.

33
00:02:33,390 --> 00:02:36,760
