May not want to mention this.

45
00:03:22,060 --> 00:03:24,350
So you ever wonder which is worse?

46
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:28,650
You know, going through labor or getting kicked in the nuts?

47
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:32,860
What?

48
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:32,860
Oh, it's just interesting.

49
00:03:33,030 --> 00:03:37,740
You know, because no one will ever know because no one can experience both.

50
00:03:41,450 --> 00:03:44,870
One of life's great unanswerable questions.

51
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:47,880
I mean, who knows?

52
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:50,550
Maybe there's something even more painful than those things.

53
00:03:54,380 --> 00:03:56,140
Like this.

54
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,810
Come in.

55
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,810
Morning.

56
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:05,730
Hey.

57
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:05,730
What's that?

58
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:09,400
Oh, it's my housewarming present for Monica and Chandler.

59
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:12,820
That's a baby chick and duck.

60
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:12,820
Uh-huh.

61
00:04:12,990 --> 00:04:15,910
And I named them Chick Jr. and Duck Jr.

62
00:04:16,410 --> 00:04:19,160
I did not see that coming.

63
00:04:16,410 --> 00:04:19,160
Uh-huh. Yeah.

64
00:04:19,330 --> 00:04:22,250
They'll love it at that new house. It has that big backyard.

65
00:04:22,410 --> 00:04:24,580
And when they're old, they can go to that farm...

66
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:27,630
...that Chandler took the other chick and duck to.

67
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:30,420
Yes.

68
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:30,420
Yeah.

69
00:04:30,590 --> 00:04:34,760
It's a shame people can't visit there.

70
00:04:30,590 --> 00:04:34,760
That is the rule though.

71
00:04:38,260 --> 00:04:41,180
Guess what. You're almost an uncle.

72
00:04:38,260 --> 00:04:41,180
