147
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:19,150
Is he okay?

148
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:19,150
He's just fine.

149
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:21,150
You did it.

150
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,940
It's a baby.

151
00:08:23,110 --> 00:08:28,910
A beautiful little baby. And some other stuff I'm gonna pretend I don't see.

152
00:08:30,830 --> 00:08:34,120
Would you like to cut the umbilical cord?

153
00:08:30,830 --> 00:08:34,120
Okay.

154
00:08:37,830 --> 00:08:39,790
Well, that's spongy.

155
00:08:41,380 --> 00:08:43,260
Oh...

156
